; ---------------------------------------------------------
; 4. Scroll-text setup (foreground layer, bottom row)
;    Foreground map is 40 cols x 25 rows starting at $#5543.
;    Row 24 (bottom) starts at $#6503.
;
;    Message tile-id legend: 14=M 15=I 16=R 17=K 18=O 19=G 20=P
;    21=E 22=S 23=N 24=T 25=H 26=C 27=1 28=6 29=* (0=space)
;
;    "MIRKROG PRESENTS THIS THING *** GREETINGS TO THE PINE16
;     SCENE *** " (66 characters, then loops)
; ---------------------------------------------------------

; --- initial fill of the visible bottom row (message[0..39]) ---
